hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"264","[AI-translation] Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo din mein sau bar Allah pak hai aur tareef usi ki hai kahe us ke gunah mita diye jaate hain chahe samandar ke jhaag jaise hon. [Tasbeeh ki fazeelat]"
"265","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh akela hai, beshareek. Badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai. [Subah sau bar ka zikr]"
"266","[AI-translation] Allah pak hai aur tareef usi ki hai, azeem Allah pak hai. [Subah-sham sau bar padhe]"
"267","[AI-translation] Allah pak hai, tareef Allah ke liye hai, Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Allah sab se bada hai. [Allah ko mehboob kalimaat]"
"268","[AI-translation] Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se koi har din hazaar nekiyan kamane se aajiz hai? Majlis mein se ek sawal karne wale ne pucha: Hum mein se koi hazaar nekiyan kaise kamae? Farmaya: Sau bar tasbeeh kahe, us ke liye hazaar nekiyan likhi jaati hain ya hazaar gunah mita diye jaate hain. [Tasbeeh ki fazeelat]"
"269","[AI-translation] Jo azeem Allah pak hai aur tareef usi ki hai kahe us ke liye jannat mein khajoor ka darakht lagaya jaata hai. [Tasbeeh ki fazeelat]"
"270","[AI-translation] Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abdullah bin Qais! Kya tujhe jannat ke khazanon mein se khazana na bataun? Main ne kaha: Kyun nahin, ya Rasulullah. Farmaya: Kaho Allah ke baghair koi taqat-quvvat nahin. [Hauqala ki fazeelat]"
"271","[AI-translation] Allah pak hai, tareef Allah ke liye hai, Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Allah sab se bada hai. [Allah ko mehboob kalimaat]"
"272","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh akela hai, beshareek, Allah bahut bada hai, tareef Allah ke liye bahut zyada, aalameen ka Rab Allah pak hai, azeez-hakeem Allah ke baghair koi taqat-quvvat nahin. Phir dua kare: Ae Allah! Mujhe bakhsh de, mujh par raham kar, mujhe hidayat de, mujhe rozi de. [Dehati ko sikhaya]"
"273","[AI-translation] Beshak behtareen dua tareef Allah ke liye hai, aur behtareen zikr Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin hai. [Hamd-tahleel ki fazeelat]"
"274","[AI-translation] Baaqi rehne wali nekiyan: Allah pak hai, tareef Allah ke liye hai, Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Allah sab se bada hai, Allah ke baghair koi taqat-quvvat nahin. [Baqiyat salihat]"
